                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                        "entry_id": "ca0e9285-c3da-38c1-aa27-6a44319c1a22",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An oven used for baking."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed2f8186-3b45-4adf-a000-22f9a2cdefc0",
                                "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                                "text": "Mexican plowmen compelled to resume work immediately after dinner would die like the peons whom the Spanish conquerors forced to work the highways in the bakeoven heat of the tropical afternoon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f48b44e4-d28e-4fe0-9221-db65583fc17d",
                                "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                                "text": "Many larger taverns maintained outdoor bakeovens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "992c3785-1d53-44a0-816f-afbf3a45edc6",
                                "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                                "text": "Sweat is everywhere. Some comes from the bakeoven heat in the boxcar; some from the pain of throbbing wounds."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1779173-a8d3-4050-ba1e-6b9114226a23",
                                "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                                "text": "At Lae, when the plane door opened, the bakeoven heat of the tropics hit me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "27cc3af5-b155-4565-9b63-312ea6cbf7bc",
                                "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                                "text": "Siena in the summer was a bakeoven, and he took heat badly, his disposition becoming as rough and sore as the rashes that mottled him horn head to toe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6132fd5b-7d50-4a06-bbad-ece60c969d41",
                                "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                                "text": "But I can’t understand why you radio hams would choose a bakeoven like Death Valley for your weekend gig."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02481530-283b-46f6-a0b3-3a5dfb854170",
                                "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                                "text": "Marshal shivered slightly in response to the icy brush of unaccustomed fear, a momentary chill that quickly suffocated in the bakeoven heat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8fbf3367-a880-4af0-856d-1f2319cb898e",
                                "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                                "text": "“I say he’s a murdering cutthroat,” fanfares the ostrich-plumed young champion of slavery for the benefit of the pre-lunch throng congregating in the bakeoven air outside Morrison’s Cafe & Groggery."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "73f71f84-de52-4fdc-8cc6-2ef1a30c1373",
                                "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                                "text": "A cookstove/bakeoven combination in which the oven is a masonry combustion chamber. […] Bakeoven chambers are generally popular options for a masonry heater. […] There are, of course, masonry bakeovens that double as primary heaters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a23ebb58-539c-49b7-a744-0b5c879b1f76",
                                "sense_id": "dd4d50b8-4600-3d12-805a-76b5b1ed6259",
                                "text": "Where fire danger was minimal, such as in the dry-climate pueblos of New Mexico, individual bakeovens predominated. […] In stone or brick summer kitchens, the privy in many cases will be seen snuggling up to the bakeoven to gain warmth in the winter season (Figure 21-3)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
